  "r-wrike-workflow": "Rerenga mahi Wrike",
  "r-wrike-workflow-note": "He rārangi tūnga te rerenga mahi Wrike, kei ia tūnga tōna rōpū Active, Completed, Deferred, Cancelled rānei. Ka tuhi te kaweatu i ngā rārangi o tēnei papa hei rerenga mahi kotahi, kua tapaina ki te ingoa o te papa, ki te JSON ka whakahokia e te API a Wrike mō ngā rerenga mahi: hangaia taua rerenga mahi i Wrike i mua i te kawemai i te kaweatu Excel Wrike o te papa, kia whakahāngaitia ōna tūnga. Ka pānui te kawemai i taua JSON kua whakapiria i runga ake, mai i WeKan, mai i te GET /workflows a Wrike rānei, ki te papa kua kōwhiria: ka huri tētahi tūnga kāore ōna rārangi hei rārangi, ā, ka tohu tētahi ture i tētahi kāri kua oti ina nekehia ki tētahi tūnga Completed, Cancelled rānei, kāore anō kia oti i tētahi Active, Deferred rānei. Kāore e taea te kaweatu i ngā ture aunoa ake a Wrike mai i Wrike.",
