  "password-length-login-count": "Te maha o ngā takiuru",
  "password-length-no-results": "Kāore he pūkete i konei.",
  "password-length-report-desc": "Ngā pūkete i takiuru me tētahi kupuhipa poto ake i te roa iti rawa. Ko te pūtirotiro anake e mōhio ana ki te roa o te kupuhipa, nā reira ka pūrongo ia i tētahi kupuhipa poto i muri i te takiuru; kāore te kupuhipa me tōna roa e wehe atu i a ia. Ko te Kua whakatika te wā i panonihia ai te kupuhipa o te pūkete - ko tētahi pūkete ka takiuru anō me tētahi kupuhipa poto ka whakaatuhia anō he poto rawa.",
