  "password-min-length-description": "Ka rārangitia ki raro ngā takiuru me tētahi kupuhipa poto ake. Kāore rawa te takiuru e whakakāhoretia mō tēnei.",
  "password-min-length-enforce": "Whakaūngia te roa iti rawa",
  "password-min-length-enforce-description": "Ka whakakāhoretia tētahi kupuhipa hou poto ake, ā, me panoni tētahi pūkete ka takiuru me tētahi kupuhipa poto ake i mua i ētahi atu mahi. Mā te panoni ka takiputa ngā wātū katoa o te pūkete. Nō te kaiwhakarato ngā kupuhipa LDAP, OAuth2, OIDC, SAML, CAS me Sandstorm, ā, kāore e arotakengia.",
  "password-change-required-text": "Ināianei e hiahia ana tēnei pae ki ngā kupuhipa kia __min__ pūāhua te iti rawa, ā, he poto ake tōu. Kōwhiria tētahi roa ake kia haere tonu ai. Kātahi ka takiputa ngā wātū katoa o tō pūkete, ā, ka takiuru anō koe me te kupuhipa hou."
